data/*

# ...except the two files that cannot be regenerated. PROTOCOL.md §8 allows one
# run, and 05-confirmatory.R enforces it by refusing to overwrite its output, so
# these are the only copies that will ever exist. 12 KB against the 78 MB of
# harvested versions that keep the rest of data/ out of here.
#
# `data/*` and not `data/`: git will not re-include a file whose parent
# DIRECTORY is excluded, and the negations below are silently dead under the
# second form. `git check-ignore` does not catch it once a file is in the index.
!data/confirmatory.json
!data/posthoc-prevalence.json
